Just wanted to quickly respond to what Romana and Betsy were discussing 
last Sunday.. (I'm behind, as usual, with responding to mail!)

Elizabeth Schwartz <betsys@cs.umb.edu>:
>I'm still mulling over this discussion but wanted to get my vote in
